values
  ('dc06723c-987b-586a-add6-f20685bd832f', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g9-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$When Tomas says he "wasn't thinking anything," Mrs. Adeyemi replies, "That is the part worth writing down." What does her reply contribute to the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It suggests she believes Tomas is lying about how he played the game.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It shows she wants an official record of every game for the club's files.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It hints that she wants Tomas to stop playing chess for a while.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It points out that his careless, thoughtless play is exactly what he must examine.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It points out that his careless, thoughtless play is exactly what he must examine.$q$, $q$Her reply turns his excuse into the lesson: not thinking is the mistake he needs to study, and studying it is what teaches him. She is not asking for club records; the notebook is for his own reflection.$q$, 'draft', 'c542e562-63e4-56f5-9fec-55eb5210faad')
