  ('89372cc6-db40-546c-864f-84cd53d8356d', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g9-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the week with the substitute driver help develop the theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Mr. Okoro should find another way to get where he is going.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It proves that arriving early is more important to riders than anything else.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"By taking away Mr. Ibarra's habits, it reveals what they had been giving the riders.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It explains that the riders are angry at Mr. Ibarra for taking time off.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$By taking away Mr. Ibarra's habits, it reveals what they had been giving the riders.$q$, $q$Without him, no one passes gloves, people stare at phones, and Farah's seatmate leaves without a hello. Farah is "glad" when he returns, so the week does not show that arriving early matters most.$q$, 'draft', 'c6ed9f45-fcff-52c9-83c0-ef74c1de5407')
