   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this post?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To explain why the museum preserves the quilt's flaws instead of making it look new","is_correct":true},{"text":"To teach visitors the steps for sewing a traditional quilt like the one on display","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"},{"text":"To apologize for the quilt's condition and promise that it will be restored soon","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"To tell the life story of the family who made the quilt and used it for decades","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To explain why the museum preserves the quilt's flaws instead of making it look new$q$, $q$The post answers the question "Why don't we fix it?" by arguing that the flaws are historical evidence worth keeping. The author says restoring it would be "erasing the very thing that makes this quilt worth seeing," so a promise to restore it contradicts the text.$q$, 'draft', '6c81c09c-9abe-5798-b04e-1be1002118ed')
