   $q$What is the author's main purpose in this column?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To describe the history of city planning in the author's neighborhood","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"off-topic"},{"text":"To argue that business owners should pay for all new public benches","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To complain that the city has too many parking meters and trash cans","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"To urge the city to add benches so that its streets work for everyone","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To urge the city to add benches so that its streets work for everyone$q$, $q$The column ends with a direct request for "a place to sit on every block of our main shopping streets within five years." Parking meters and trash cans are mentioned only to show what streets have instead of benches.$q$, 'draft', '2fc06731-7ede-5214-b1b1-e08f9aa49554')
