   $q$What is the main purpose of the paragraph about Marisol's memory of Tova?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that Marisol still resents Tova for slowing her down during her own first conference race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It explains why Marisol, despite her reluctance, commits fully to helping Hana: she was once in Hana's place.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It reveals that Tova will appear later in the race to help both Marisol and Hana up the hill.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It proves that Marisol was always a calm, steady runner who never made mistakes as a freshman.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains why Marisol, despite her reluctance, commits fully to helping Hana: she was once in Hana's place.$q$, $q$The memory shows that Marisol herself once sprinted out and "walked the hill in tears" until a senior helped, which gives her a second, competing motive to help Hana. It shows gratitude, not resentment, and she was clearly not a calm freshman.$q$, 'draft', 'ffec356f-cab5-57b8-a052-9c859ab56621')
